 "description": "Opengear CM8008-C Console Manager, a half-width 1RU appliance. It has eight RJ45 RS-232 serial ports and two combo network ports, each an RJ45 or SFP. It has two USB 3.0 ports and a USB-C console port. Two 12 VDC power jacks are on the rear, and one adapter is supplied. A 5G cellular modem is fitted, with four antenna jacks and two SIM slots on the rear.",
